OL,3,ANowak killer given leave to appeal
OL,4,Aagainst sentence
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe man who murdered student Henry
OL,7,FNowak is being allowed to appeal
OL,8,Fagainst the length of his sentence.
OL,10,FVickrum Digwa stabbed 18-year-old Henry
OL,11,FNowak to death in Southampton in
OL,12,FDecember 2025. In June, he was jailed
OL,13,Ffor life with a minimum term of 21
OL,14,Fyears.
OL,16,FHe has now been given permission to
OL,17,Fchallenge the length of that sentence
OL,18,Fat the Court of Appeal on 5 November.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
